---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Support" description="Need help with the Aya & Sura app? Contact Aya & Sura support.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p>Need help with the Aya &amp; Sura app? We’re here to help.</p>
      <p>For questions, technical issues, account support, or general assistance, please contact us by email:</p>
      <p><strong>Support Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@ayasura.com">support@ayasura.com</a></p>
      <p>When contacting support, please include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name</li>
        <li>The email address associated with your account</li>
        <li>A short description of the issue</li>
        <li>Screenshots, if helpful</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We will do our best to respond as soon as possible.</p>

      <h2>Common Support Topics</h2>
      <p>You may contact us for help with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Logging in or account access</li>
        <li>Membership or subscription questions</li>
        <li>App features or content access</li>
        <li>Technical issues or bugs</li>
        <li>Account deletion requests</li>
        <li>Privacy or data questions</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>App Information</h2>
      <p><strong>App Name:</strong> Aya &amp; Sura<br />
      <strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://ayasura.com">https://ayasura.com</a><br />
      <strong>Support Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@ayasura.com">support@ayasura.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
